  <item>
    <title>E01. 朝圣冈仁波齐：在神山脚下被灌顶是什么样的体验？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673c0b72f373fe5d4d6981c1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673c0b72f373fe5d4d6981c1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 04:17:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Hello！Hello！【山顶灵魂】第一期节目来啦！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>作为这档节目的第一期，橙子和豆豆女士介绍了本次节目的缘起就是希望给更多对</span><strong><span>灵性，疗愈，修行</span></strong><span>感兴趣的朋友们，搭建一个分享各种故事，体验和感受的平台！八仙过海，各显神通我们接下来会陆续邀请各位“技能”不同，“专业”不同的师兄师姐们来做客分享，也欢迎有兴趣的伙伴联系我们做嘉宾哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个和神山的约定和一次为期十三天的修行之旅，橙子和豆豆将站在一个刚踏入修行门槛的菜鸟视角，给大家讲述，</span><strong><span>去冈仁波齐朝山和在神山脚下被灌顶</span></strong><span>是什么样的体验。虽然说每个人的根器，因缘都不同，可是在修行的路上，大家面临的问题和心境却或多或少有共通之处。我们在迷茫中找到前进的方向，在阻碍中重新认识到自己的勇气，在永恒的爱中找到了超脱，平静与喜悦。有缘人自会在茫茫人海中相聚，而每一次我们碰撞所产生的能量，也会给当下的时空带来美丽的光。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期你将听到：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>冈仁波齐的传讯</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>圆觉经与大圆满的法门</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冥想中看到如来法会的神圣时刻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>什么是清净，圆满的信</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>通过灌顶和源头链接的体验</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>灵魂找到回家的路</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>为什么说修行其实是从梦中醒来？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>广告时间：</span></strong></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsi4wXpeyA65naJFaCvOpGbUGR9R.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期目录：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2">00:02</a> 橙子开场介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>问候听众并介绍播客主题：分享玄学、疗愈、修行的个人经历。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>介绍本期主题西藏之旅和灌顶仪式。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 豆豆介绍</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>豆豆远程参与修行，介绍自己的公益背景和佛学修行经验。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“山顶灵魂”项目的主创人。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 修行经历回顾</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>与其木老师的修行经历，从2021年开始的课程学习。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>合作缘起和共同的出海项目。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 冈仁波齐梦境与水晶山</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>三角形水晶的梦境，以及与冈仁波齐山（水晶山）的联系。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 冈仁波齐的向往与修行</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>冈仁波齐之旅的缘起和它的“金刚之力”。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 其木老师的占卜与灵性任务</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>讨论项目的成功与否，和更深层的“灵性上的任务”。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> 橙子的冥想体验和传讯</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>橙子在冥想中得到的肢体反应和能量感受。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冥想中接收到的传讯，指引她前往冈仁波齐。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 梅花易数占卜与修行</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>其木老师通过易经占卜，以及老师对橙子“不好好学习”的敲打。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 承担如来家业与修行任务</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>讨论承担修行任务和个人使命。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 修行方法与个人根器</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>占察善恶业报经</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">21:01</a> 圆觉经与大圆满修行</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>圆觉经其实是藏密中大圆满的法门</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 修行中的嗔恨心，挑战，与舒适圈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>如何通过修行平衡内心的嗔恨心。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>修行就是不断跳出舒适圈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1581">26:21</a> 地藏经与修行的指导</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>豆豆分享地藏经占察轮的修行指导和老师的开示。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 修行的真相与无我</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>修行中的“无我”和对真相“如是”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小我的局限和橙子世界观的改变。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 修行的愿力与真理的接近</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>修行中的“半信半疑”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>橙子讲述发愿接近真理</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> 业力清洗与修行的疑惑</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>业力清洗和豆豆修行中的疑惑。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>浮于表面形式的修行会给你一种“我在进步”的安慰。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 顿悟，渐修，净信</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>顿悟的“Leap of Faith”和渐修的“量变产生质变”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>什么是清净，圆满的信？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">39:32</a> 圣湖旁灌顶的体验</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在玛旁雍错湖的冥想和灌顶体验。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2449">40:49</a> 冈仁波齐转山的阻碍和挑战</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>橙子转山被劝退。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>转山过程中的美景和体验。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> 转山的戏剧性时刻和其木老师的支持</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>决定继续转山的关键时刻和与导游沟通的过程。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>其木老师的支持，“舍命陪君子”。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 冈仁波齐山脚下的灌顶，最好的生日礼物</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>转山过程中的能量爆发和坚持。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>灌顶是26岁的生日礼物。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">55:09</a> 灌顶带来的链接和感悟</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>灌顶过程中感受到的强烈能量和感动。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上师的恩德，宇宙的眷顾。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> 灵魂回家的感受</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>灵魂找到回家的路，泪如雨下。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3592">59:52</a> 最后一次灌顶时的画面，法会和光体</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>冥想体验带来的内在改变。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>豆豆分享冥想中法会的画面和感受。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3913">65:13</a> 个体差异会造成不同的冥想体验</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>左脑和右脑？“看得见”和“看不见”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>冥想中的实证连接和圆满信。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4531">75:31</a> 讨论佛学修行中的核心秘意</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>空性，无我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>什么是明心见性？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4766">79:26</a> 修行其实是从梦中醒来</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>修行中大梦初醒的感受，清醒和梦中的状态。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>上下波动的能量状态。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4916">81:56</a> 灵性的增益buff</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>修行对现实生活的影响。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如如不动，了了分明。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5275">87:55</a> 总结</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>总结播客内容，并期待听众的反馈和未来的分享。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Song: Dosi &amp; Aisake - Cruising [NCS Release]</span></p><span></span><p><span>Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds</span></p><span></span><p><span>Free Download/Stream: <a data-url="http://ncs.io/Cruising" href="http://ncs.io/Cruising">ncs.io</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>Watch: <a data-url="http://ncs.lnk.to/CruisingAT/youtube" href="http://ncs.lnk.to/CruisingAT/youtube">ncs.lnk.to</a></span></p>]]></description>
